<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Livestock analysts estimate Monday's hog slaughter from 333,000 to 355,000 head versus 366,000 a week ago and 331,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 110,000 to 124,000 head versus 111,000 a week ago and 120,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725</p>
